SUMMARY:Thursday Social @ Great Bear Vineyards
DESCRIPTION:Thursday Social at Great Bear Vineyards in Davis   Thursday\, August 27 | 5–8 PMTicket Includes: Your First Glass of WineWe’re excited to kick off our new Thursday Socials—the perfect way to ease into the weekend a little early!Gather your friends\, leave work behind\, and join us for a relaxed summer evening of award-winning wine\, great conversation\, and a little friendly competition in the beautiful setting of Great Bear Vineyards.For $15\, your ticket includes your first glass of wine\, so all you have to do is find your favorite spot among the vines and settle in for the evening.Feeling competitive? We’ve got you covered! We’ll have a selection of classic board games available\, including chess\, draughts\, Bananagrams\, and dominos. Challenge your friends to a game\, meet someone new\, or simply sit back\, sip your wine\, and enjoy the vineyard atmosphere. Cheese and light snacks will be available for purchase\, or you’re welcome to bring your own picnic and make an evening of it.Whether you’re catching up with friends\, planning a casual date night\, or looking for a new weekly tradition\, Thursday Social is all about slowing down\, sharing good company\, and enjoying summer evenings at the vineyard.Good wine. Great friends. Beautiful vineyard views. We can’t wait to welcome you to Thursday Social!
URL:https://visityolo.com/event/thursday-social-great-bear-vineyards/
LOCATION:Great Bear Vineyards\, Great Bear Vineyards  24800 Co Rd 101A\, Davis\, CA 95616
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://visityolo.com/wp-content/uploads/Highway128PressTrip_GreatBearVineyards_2024_MaxWhittaker_12-Copy-scaled.jpg
ORGANIZER;CN="Great Bear Vineyards":MAILTO:greatbearvineyards@gmail.com
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260827T173000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260827T183000
DTSTAMP:20260730T225156Z
CREATED:20260730T225156Z
LAST-MODIFIED:20260730T225156Z
UID:10014589-1787851800-1787855400@visityolo.com
SUMMARY:Tai Chi Basics
DESCRIPTION:Tai Chi Basics Course in Davis  Thursday\, August 27 | 5:30–6:30 PM\nTicket Includes: Tai Chi Class\nSlow down\, breathe deeply\, and find your balance with an evening of Tai Chi at Great Bear Vineyards.\nJoin us every Thursday evening for our Tai Chi Basics Course\, a welcoming introduction to the ancient practice of Tai Chi. Through slow\, flowing movements and mindful breathing\, you’ll build balance\, improve strength and flexibility\, reduce stress\, and leave feeling refreshed and recharged.\nThis beginner-friendly class focuses on the fundamental drills and postures that provide the greatest health benefits while laying the foundation for a deeper Tai Chi practice. Whether you’re completely new to Tai Chi or looking to refine the basics\, everyone is welcome.\n Meet Your Instructor\nDaniel Pfister has practiced Tai Chi for nearly 30 years. He received intensive training while living in Taiwan for five years and later completed his master’s thesis on the effects of Tai Chi stance training on blood pressure. His approachable teaching style makes this class enjoyable and accessible for participants of all experience levels.\nAfter class\, you’re invited to stay and enjoy Thursday Social! Relax with a glass of wine\, challenge friends to a board game\, or simply unwind in the peaceful vineyard setting as the sun begins to set.\nCome discover why Tai Chi is often called “meditation in motion” and experience the perfect blend of wellness\, community\, and vineyard charm.\nWe look forward to moving with you!
URL:https://visityolo.com/event/tai-chi-basics/
LOCATION:Great Bear Vineyards\, Great Bear Vineyards  24800 Co Rd 101A\, Davis\, CA 95616
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://visityolo.com/wp-content/uploads/Great-Bear-Vineyards_23GBV-drone-scaled.jpg
ORGANIZER;CN="Great Bear Vineyards":MAILTO:greatbearvineyards@gmail.com
END:VEVENT
