SUMMARY:Tote Embroidery Workshop
DESCRIPTION:Tote Embroidery Workshop in Davis \nSunday\, August 30\, 1-4 PM \n$25 Members\, $40 Non-Members (All materials included) \n  \nWith instructor Katherine Klein\, learn classic embroidery stitches (straight stitch\, back stitch\, french knots\, chain stitch\, satin stitch) to create a unique floral design on a Pence Gallery canvas tote. Each participant will receive a tote bag that features the Pence building and logo. This workshop is open to ages 12 and up and is perfect for beginners; no prior embroidery experience is necessary. \n  \nRegister here: https://pencegallery.org/education/programs/workshops-and-classes/ \n  \nAny questions? Email pencegallery@gmail.com.
URL:https://visityolo.com/event/tote-embroidery-workshop/
LOCATION:Pence Gallery\, 212 D Street\, Davis\, CA 95616
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/png:https://visityolo.com/wp-content/uploads/Sample-Embroidery-Photo.png
ORGANIZER;CN="Pence Gallery":MAILTO:pencesocialmedia@gmail.com
END:VEVENT
